                                                            <section class="mp-section mp-section--tint" id="faq">
                                                                <div class="container">
                                                                    <div class="mp-section__head">
                                                                        <h2>Common questions</h2>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="accordion mp-accordion" id="faqList">
                                                                        @{
                                                                            var faqs = new[]
                                                                            {
                            ("Does MunPath tell me what to take?", "No. It shows programs that align with your results and explains why. It doesn't guarantee admission, success, or a career outcome. The decision is yours."),
                            ("How long does the assessment take?", "About 10 minutes. You answer 30 short statements on a five-point scale, and you can go back to change an answer before you submit."),
                            ("Which strand do I need?", "Any Senior High School strand works. MunPath considers your strand when suggesting programs and tells you when a program usually expects a different one."),
                            ("Can I retake the assessment?", "Yes. Your interests can change, and you can retake the assessment whenever you want. Earlier attempts stay in your assessment history."),
                            ("Is my information private?", "Your results are tied to your account, and you can delete your account and data at any time from your profile settings. See the privacy notice for details.")
                        };
                                                                        }
                                                                        @for (int i = 0; i < faqs.Length; i++)
                                                                        {
                                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                                                                                    <button class="accordion-button @(i == 0 ? "" : "collapsed")" type="button"
                                                                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq@(i)"
                                                                                            aria-expanded="@(i == 0 ? "true" : "false")"
                                                                                            aria-controls="faq@(i)">@faqs[i].Item1</button>
                                                                                </h3>
                                                                                <div id="faq@(i)" class="accordion-collapse collapse @(i == 0 ? "show" : "")"
                                                                                     data-bs-parent="#faqList">
                                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">@faqs[i].Item2</div>
                                                                                </div>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                        }
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </section>

